{"game": "earth-defense-force-5", "language": "english", "appid": 1007040, "month": "2020-05", "window": 4, "start_date": 1590278400, "end_date": 1590969599, "month_true_total": 104, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-09-28 17:48:43 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "70081254", "author": {"steamid": "76561198035792915", "personaname": "Butts McGee", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/GothicMonkey/", "num_games_owned": 1433, "num_reviews": 76, "playtime_forever": 5465, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 952, "last_played": 1703589517, "avatar": "b2f7c17649cf8c79711df73550c0e5970f1cee4d"}, "language": "english", "review": "Damn those giant f̶r̶o̶g̶  human like aliens", "timestamp_created": 1590906702, "timestamp_updated": 1592144142, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1562828575", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "70042709", "author": {"steamid": "76561198129101720", "personaname": "BluefootFox", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Quina_Rose/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 17201, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2577, "last_played": 1715215846, "avatar": "b3c041f3eb316e0edf16e6ba36f426b433e16cee"}, "language": "english", "review": "This is so much fun.  EDF5 is somehow casual and intense, whimsical and serious. You're defending Earth from a massive alien invasion.  You'll be in the middle of a bullet hell having brought the wrong gear on the verge of defeat when your cohort starts singing 'Oh we are the valiant Infantry...', and you'll burst into laughter.  The game has an element of whimsy to it, pure terror when things go horribly wrong, and requires a good amount of strategy. \n\nThe classes are well-balanced.  There's no quick-timing.  Just you, a somewhat ordinary soldier, and a massive hoard of of ever-increasing and ever more difficult monsters.  Just when you thought you were at peak in the game, it throws something else at you.  I have 42 hours now, mostly played on Normal, and I have not finished the level pack.  I just got the 10% completion achievement.  Some friends jumped in hard mode with new profiles and we spent an afternoon laughing and having our kiesters kicked.  You can tailor the difficulty.  Hard mode is what it says it is.  I haven't unlocked Inferno mode yet, but can't wait.\n\nEDF5 is exactly what it claims to be, and this game is the archetype of the genre in every good way.", "timestamp_created": 1590843470, "timestamp_updated": 1590843470, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1562828575", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "69986931", "author": {"steamid": "76561198057065856", "personaname": "BusinessVader", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198057065856/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 5662, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 491, "last_played": 1765619965, "avatar": "1521e8085f447ad99f1bb13f30d768bcfafa8e6e"}, "language": "english", "review": "Watch out for Airstrikes", "timestamp_created": 1590749799, "timestamp_updated": 1590749799, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1562828575", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "69931333", "author": {"steamid": "76561198008573498"